question:
The following change is made to `staging/src/k8s.io/component-helpers/nodedeclaredfeatures/types.go`:

```go
// Before
type Feature interface {
	// Name returns the feature's well-known name.
	Name() string

	// Discover checks if a node provides the feature based on its configuration.
	Discover(cfg *NodeConfiguration) bool

	// InferForScheduling checks if pod scheduling requires the feature.
	InferForScheduling(podInfo *PodInfo) bool

	// InferForUpdate checks if a pod update requires the feature.
	InferForUpdate(oldPodInfo, newPodInfo *PodInfo) bool

	// MaxVersion specifies the upper bound Kubernetes version (inclusive) for this feature's relevance
	// as a scheduling factor.
	MaxVersion() *version.Version
}

// After
type Feature interface {
	// Name returns the feature's well-known name.
	Name() string

	// Discover checks if a node provides the feature based on its configuration.
	Discover(cfg *NodeConfiguration) bool

	// InferForScheduling checks if pod scheduling requires the feature.
	InferForScheduling(podInfo *PodInfo) bool

	// InferForUpdate checks if a pod update requires the feature.
	InferForUpdate(oldPodInfo, newPodInfo *PodInfo) bool

	// MaxVersion specifies the upper bound Kubernetes version (inclusive) for this feature's relevance
	// as a scheduling factor.
	MaxVersion() *version.Version

	// IsVersionGated returns true if this feature's relevance is bounded by MaxVersion.
	IsVersionGated() bool
}
```

The new method `IsVersionGated` must be implemented by all concrete types that satisfy `Feature`. No changes are made to any other file.

Which files within the `kubernetes/kubernetes` repository would fail to compile as a result of this change? List each file by its path relative to the repository root.
